1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:04,076
The question that no executioner in the
Holy Roman Empire ever recorded an answer

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,276
to is this:

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:08,936
At what point during the vertical
bisection of a living human body

4
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,676
does consciousness end?

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:14,236
The method was reserved
for crimes beyond ordinary treason.

6
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,856
The condemned was stripped,

7
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,096
bound at the ankles,

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,836
and suspended upside
down from a wooden frame.

9
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,056
A large two-handled saw was
positioned at the groin.

10
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:27,141
Two executioners began pulling the blade
downward through the center of the body.

